  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-year support to the UN Peacebuilding Fund 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cf. the Danish Organisation Strategy for support to prevention, peacebuilding and sustaining peace efforts of the United Nations for the relevant results framework.  

Peacebuilding Fund (PBF) global results reporting (annual reports, Secretary-General reports, quarterly data) is available here: https://www.un.org/peacebuilding/content/results</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Secretary-General&#x2019;s Peacebuilding Fund (PBF) is the organisation&#x2019;s financial instrument of first resort to sustain peace in countries or situations at risk or affected by violent conflict. The PBF may invest with UN entities, governments, regional organisations, multilateral banks, national multi-donor trust funds or civil society organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
